    {
      "id": "FR-001",
      "title": "The package carries exactly the 18 rows that the skill registry declares with scope product and owner fs-gg-rendering; the packed count equals 18 and the set difference against the registry is empty in both directions. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-001, AC-003)",
      "text": "The package carries exactly the 18 rows that the skill registry declares with scope product and owner fs-gg-rendering; the packed count equals 18 and the set difference against the registry is empty in both directions. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-001, AC-003)",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "AC-001",
        "AC-003"
      ],
      "priority": null,
      "classification": [],
      "source": "work/1240-rendering-skills-package/spec.md",
