  "decisions": [
    {
      "id": "DEC-001",
      "title": "decision: Packed from where they are; nothing is relocated. The producer manifest already carries a per-row supplied-by path and the stager joins supplied-by with SKILL.md, so an out-of-tree source costs the packer nothing. Relocating would move bodies the fs-gg-ui template emits (violating SB-005) and would invalidate the source paths the org skill registry records for these rows. The count is three, not two: fs-gg-project is sourced from template/base/.agents/skills/fs-gg-project/ and is a third out-of-tree row alongside fs-gg-feedback-report and fs-gg-samples.",
      "decision": "decision: Packed from where they are; nothing is relocated. The producer manifest already carries a per-row supplied-by path and the stager joins supplied-by with SKILL.md, so an out-of-tree source costs the packer nothing. Relocating would move bodies the fs-gg-ui template emits (violating SB-005) and would invalidate the source paths the org skill registry records for these rows. The count is three, not two: fs-gg-project is sourced from template/base/.agents/skills/fs-gg-project/ and is a third out-of-tree row alongside fs-gg-feedback-report and fs-gg-samples.",
